 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1025  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:08Z (RFD66606-1025) 'VoxHammer carries no weights of its own. It edits with the TRELLIS.2
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1025  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:09Z (RFD66606-1025) 'backbone, thus its cost is the TRELLIS.2 cost.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1025  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:10Z (RFD66606-1025) '`weftspun_image_to_world` runs TripoSplat and then TRELLIS.2. Its cost
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1025  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:11Z (RFD66606-1025) 'is the sum of those two. RFD66606-1033 covers the geometric algorithms,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1025  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:12Z (RFD66606-1025) 'which hold no weights at all.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1025  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:13Z (RFD66606-1025) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1025  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:14Z (RFD66606-1025) 'The blocklisted Hunyuan models add 9.2 GB. The shape model holds
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1025  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:15Z (RFD66606-1025) '3.3 B parameters, which is 6.6 GB. The paint model holds 1.3 B
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1025  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:16Z (RFD66606-1025) 'parameters, which is 2.6 GB.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1025  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:17Z (RFD66606-1025) 'The problem
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1025  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:18Z (RFD66606-1025) 'A reader cannot size a machine from the inventory alone. The backend must decide which
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1025  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:19Z (RFD66606-1025) 'models stay resident, and that decision needs a number per model.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1025  1 LINE
 Text:Written
